    "DisplayTitle": "DEAD SAINTS -- Rookie Rank, Large Scale Cargo Run",
    "Description": "If you're looking for creds, the Saints need someone with hauling experience to do a supply run from <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> to <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>. \n\nYou're gonna need a ship that can hold size <EM4>~mission(MissionMaxSCUSize) cargo containers</EM4> and a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> to move the boxes around. \n\nDon't open the crates but just so you know, most of this stuff is legal but not all of it. Try not to cross paths with anyone who might make that a problem for you. Get me?\n\n-Twitch",
    "DescriptionKey": "DeadSaints_HaulCargo_AToB_desc_ToGrimHEX_Danger",
    "DisplayDescription": "If you're looking for creds, the Saints need someone with hauling experience to do a supply run from <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> to <EM4>Grim HEX</EM4>. \n\nYou're gonna need a ship that can hold size <EM4>16 SCU cargo containers</EM4> and a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> to move the boxes around. \n\nDon't open the crates but just so you know, most of this stuff is legal but not all of it. Try not to cross paths with anyone who might make that a problem for you. Get me?\n\n-Twitch",
